                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <div class="rn-trust-item">

                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i>

                        <span>
                            Verified Process
                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <div class="rn-trust-item">

                        <i class="bi bi-people"></i>

                        <span>
                            Community Focused
                        </span>

